    { "type": "沙漠深處有一座靠發條運轉的鐘錶城，居民每天輪流替巨大的鐘上發條，沒上緊的街道會慢慢被風沙埋掉。" },
    { "wait": 600 },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/00-idea.jpg" },
    { "clickText": "撰寫世界" },
    { "wait": 2500 },
    { "eval": "document.querySelector('[data-stream-preview]')?.innerText.slice(0,600) ?? 'no preview'" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/01-world-streaming.jpg" },
    { "wait": 2500 },
    { "eval": "document.querySelector('[data-stream-preview]')?.innerText.slice(0,1200) ?? 'no preview'" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/02-world-streaming-later.jpg" },
    { "wait": 1500 },
    { "eval": "document.querySelector('[data-usage-line]')?.innerText" },
    { "eval": "[...document.querySelectorAll('textarea,input')].map(e=>e.value.slice(0,70))" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/03-world-cards.jpg" },
    { "clickText": "繼續寫故事" },
    { "wait": 3000 },
    { "eval": "document.querySelector('[data-stream-preview]')?.scrollIntoView({block:'center'}); document.querySelector('[data-stream-preview]')?.innerText.slice(0,800) ?? 'no preview'" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/04-story-streaming.jpg" },
    { "wait": 2500 },
    { "eval": "document.querySelector('[data-stream-preview]')?.scrollIntoView({block:'center'}); document.querySelector('[data-stream-preview]')?.innerText.slice(0,1500) ?? 'no preview'" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/05-story-streaming-later.jpg" },
    { "wait": 4000 },
    { "eval": "document.querySelector('[data-usage-line]')?.innerText" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/06-story.jpg" },
    { "clickText": "前往建立" },
    { "wait": 1500 },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/07-build-review.jpg" },
    { "clickText": "建立並開始玩" },
    { "eval": "(async()=>{for(let i=0;i<160;i++){if(document.body.innerText.includes('取消顯影'))return 'witnessing';await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,250));}return document.body.innerText.slice(0,300);})()" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/08-built.jpg" },
    { "wait": 3000 },
    { "clickText": "取消顯影" },
    { "wait": 1500 },
    { "eval": "document.body.innerText.slice(0,200)" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/09-witness-cancelled.jpg" },
    { "clickText": "重新顯影" },
    { "eval": "(async()=>{for(let i=0;i<160;i++){if(/已記/.test(document.body.innerText))return document.body.innerText.slice(0,120);await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,250));}return 'still writing';})()" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/10-witnessed.jpg" },
    { "clickText": "用量" },
    { "wait": 1200 },
    { "eval": "document.body.innerText.split('AI 用量')[1]?.slice(0,900)" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/11-usage-panel.jpg" },
    { "clickText": "關閉" },
    { "wait": 500 },
    { "clickText": "← 主頁" },
    { "wait": 1500 },
    { "clickText": "創作遊戲" },
    { "wait": 1200 },
    { "clickText": "開始新的遊戲" },
    { "wait": 1500 },
    { "eval": "document.querySelectorAll('input')[0].focus()" },
    { "type": "潮間燈塔" },
    { "eval": "document.querySelectorAll('input')[1].focus()" },
    { "type": "一座漲潮時會被海水圍住的燈塔島，島民輪流在退潮時涉水去對岸補給。" },
    { "wait": 800 },
    { "clickText": "撰寫世界" },
    { "wait": 9000 },
    { "clickText": "繼續寫故事" },
    { "wait": 13000 },
    { "clickText": "前往建立" },
    { "wait": 1500 },
    { "clickText": "建立並開始玩" },
    { "eval": "(async()=>{const t0=Date.now();for(let i=0;i<200;i++){const b=[...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(x=>x.innerText.trim()==='取消'&&x.parentElement?.parentElement?.innerText.includes('詢問模型'));if(b){await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,1500));b.click();return {clickedAfterMs:Date.now()-t0, card:b.parentElement.parentElement.innerText};}await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,250));}return {notFound:document.body.innerText.slice(0,500)};})()" },
    { "wait": 1500 },
    { "eval": "document.body.innerText.slice(0,700)" },
    { "shot": "docs/e2e/milestone-rev6-create/12-chapter-cancelled.jpg" },
    { "eval": "(async()=>{for(let i=0;i<120;i++){if(/已記/.test(document.body.innerText))return document.body.innerText.slice(0,60);await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,250));}return 'still writing';})()" }
  ]
}
